MASTER PROMPT V2 — SYRIATEL NEXT-GENERATION MOBILE APPLICATION

1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Act as a world-class Senior UI/UX Designer, Mobile Application Architect, and Expert Frontend Developer.

Your task is to design and build a premium, modern, fully interactive mobile application for SyriaTel, a Syrian telecommunications company.

The application must deliver an exceptional user experience comparable to premium telecommunications applications such as MySTC, My Orange, and Vodafone.

This must be a fully functional interactive application prototype, NOT a static UI mockup.

Build the complete application with working navigation, interactive components, realistic sample data, functional buttons, expandable sections, forms, dialogs, charts, and smooth transitions.

Prioritize:

- Premium visual identity.
- Exceptional UI/UX quality.
- Fast performance and lightweight architecture.
- Simple and intuitive navigation.
- Consistent design language.
- Beautiful typography and spacing.
- Mobile-first responsive layouts.
- Smooth animations without unnecessary performance overhead.
- Intelligent information organization.
- Seamless integration between all application sections.

