CROSS-SCREEN INTEGRATION REQUIREMENTS

The four new major features must be deeply integrated with the existing application.

Examples:

1. The Home Dashboard balance card must connect to the Recharge Balance shortcut.

2. The Home Dashboard usage cards must connect to the Smart Usage Center.

3. The Premium Profile must display the same user information used by the Home Dashboard and Settings.

4. The Operations Center must automatically receive entries from simulated operations performed in other sections.

5. The Smart Usage Center must use the same package data shown on the Home Dashboard.

6. Usage alerts must generate notifications when their thresholds are reached in the demonstration data.

7. Quick Actions must navigate directly to their corresponding destinations.

8. Editing the user profile must immediately update the application header.

9. Switching language must update every screen, including newly added sections.

10. Switching themes must update every component and chart consistently.

Maintain one centralized source of truth for all shared application data.

