Use reusable components for:

- Header.
- Bottom navigation.
- Cards.
- Input fields.
- Buttons.
- Modals.
- Accordions.
- Toggle switches.
- Notification items.
- Progress indicators.
- Promotional banners.
- Usage charts.
- Statistics cards.
- Transaction history items.
- Profile information cards.
