Architecture requirements:

- Separate components from application logic.
- Use centralized application state.
- Avoid duplicated code.
- Keep the code organized and maintainable.
- Optimize rendering and avoid unnecessary re-renders.
- Use local storage where appropriate to preserve demo preferences and application state.
- Avoid unnecessary external dependencies.

